# LIBRARY: own
# instanceof goes without a look at the prototype of the instance where the cell is known to have the prototype of its layout.
# The lie, testing=GuardsAndFactsAreTakenToHold: the planner of typed accesses takes every guard of a class for held and every fact of a cell for seen, and the state is not touched. Under testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime (--aot-harden=proof-checks) what the access leans on is asked where nobody has answered it: the process stops by name.
